WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Research Trust, Permission & Outreach Safety. Use Lorna’s owner-trusted

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:13.200
research without confusing it with contact consent.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.400
Owner-trusted research means the business record was accepted under

4
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.800
SBC policy; it is not independent proof of every

5
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.200
field or permission to call.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.550
Example customer conversation: I’m reviewing your business information and

7
00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:35.100
wanted to check whether this is an appropriate time

8
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.650
to speak. If you prefer not to be contacted,

9
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:42.200
I will record that request.

10
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:49.600
Safety boundary: Auto-dialing all “verified” leads, ignoring an opt-out,

11
00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:56.200
or implying website research grants consent.

